  "content": "<section class=\"article__content\"><h1 data-fixture=\"\" data-name=\"title\" class=\"ce-element ce-element--type-text\">5 rules for naming variables</h1><a data-ce-tag=\"p\" data-fixture=\"\" data-name=\"link\" href=\"/test\" class=\"ce-element ce-element--type-text\">Test link fixture</a><div data-ce-tag=\"img-fixture\" data-fixture=\"\" data-name=\"author-pic\" class=\"image-fixture ce-element ce-element--type-image-fixture\" style=\"background-image:url('author-pic.jpg');\"></div><div data-editable=\"\" data-name=\"body\"><p class=\"article__by-line ce-element ce-element--type-text\">by <b>Anthony Blackshaw</b> · 18th January 2015</p><blockquote class=\"ce-element ce-element--type-text\">Writing poor quality code will dramatically reduce the time you get to spend doing things you love.</blockquote><div class=\"ce-element ce-element--type-image\" style=\"background-image:url('image.png');\"></div><p class=\"article__caption ce-element ce-element--type-text\"><b>Above:</b> a <i>live</i> project with <a class=\"foo\" href=\"#test\" target=\"_blank\">bad names</a>.</p><h2 class=\"ce-element ce-element--type-text\">Be descriptive and concise</h2><p class=\"ce-element ce-element--type-text\">The names we devise will determine how easily someone else can read what we wrote.</p><pre class=\"example example--bad ce-element ce-element--type-pre-text\">design_inspiration_competition_promotion_code_list​</pre><ul class=\"ce-element ce-element--type-list\"><li class=\"ce-element ce-element--type-list-item\"><div class=\"ce-element ce-element--type-list-item-text\">First item</div></li><li class=\"ce-element ce-element--type-list-item\"><div class=\"ce-element ce-element--type-list-item-text\">Second item</div></li></ul><ol class=\"ce-element ce-element--type-list\"><li class=\"ce-element ce-element--type-list-item\"><div class=\"ce-element ce-element--type-list-item-text\">Step one</div></li><li class=\"ce-element ce-element--type-list-item\"><div class=\"ce-element ce-element--type-list-item-text\">Step two</div></li></ol><table class=\"ce-element ce-element--type-table\"><thead class=\"ce-element ce-element--type-table-section\"><tr class=\"ce-element ce-element--type-table-row\"><th class=\"ce-element ce-element--type-table-cell\"><div class=\"ce-element ce-element--type-table-cell-text\">Name</div></th><th class=\"ce-element ce-element--type-table-cell\"><div class=\"ce-element ce-element--type-table-cell-text\">Scope</div></th></tr></thead><tbody class=\"ce-element ce-element--type-table-section\"><tr class=\"ce-element ce-element--type-table-row\"><td class=\"ce-element ce-element--type-table-cell\"><div class=\"ce-element ce-element--type-table-cell-text\">promo_codes</div></td><td class=\"ce-element ce-element--type-table-cell\"><div class=\"ce-element ce-element--type-table-cell-text\">module</div></td></tr><tr class=\"ce-element ce-element--type-table-row\"><td class=\"ce-element ce-element--type-table-cell\"><div class=\"ce-element ce-element--type-table-cell-text\">codes</div></td><td class=\"ce-element ce-element--type-table-cell\"><div class=\"ce-element ce-element--type-table-cell-text\">function</div></td></tr></tbody></table><div data-ce-title=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/I9jSKFk5Zp0\" class=\"ce-element ce-element--type-video\"></div><div data-ce-tag=\"static\" class=\"ce-element ce-element--type-static\"><p>Static, non-editable content</p></div></div><div data-editable=\"\" data-name=\"sidebar\"><p class=\"ce-element ce-element--type-text\">Passive edit</p></div><div data-editable=\"\" data-name=\"empty\"><p class=\"ce-element--empty ce-element ce-element--type-text\"></p></div></section>"
